# avengers_infinity_le 1.10 - PAD-420: one port per newest build, from this build's framework-generation draft and the same
# title's proven port, with other titles' feature lines taken out (docs/plans/pad420_mode_sweep.md).
# Emulator-proven 2026-10-07 by a full build check (modes/gamecheck.sh play full, the stock card, hidden, muted):
# the runtime hooked the game, 29 of its 43 shots came from their switches, a drain ended a ball,
# a tilted ball and three balls to the game's end; events seen firing: game_start, ball_start, ball_end, bonus_start, bonus_end, tilt_warning, tilt.
# Shots no press made: Disc, Inner loop, Left outlane, Left spinner, Marvel (0x4000), Pops, Right orbit (0x4000000000), Right outlane, Scoop arrow, Shot 0x10000, Shot 0x400, Shot 0x40000, Shot 0x8000, Shot 0x80000.

